  <prompt><![CDATA[
Out-of-plan polish pass on the deployed v1.3.0 RegardingResolver. Owner
feedback after Wave 8 UAT visual: 7 targeted changes plus a version bump
across the 7 anchors documented in SRFR-033's Version Update Checklist.

Scope (all in `src/client/pcf/RegardingResolver/`):

1. `title` manifest input default: "Related Record" → "RELATED RECORD"; and
   render title UPPERCASED in the app regardless of maker input (defensive).
2. New manifest input `showVersionFooter` (TwoOptions, default true) —
   conditionally hides the version footer.
3. Right-side lookup icon direction matches OOB Dataverse lookup convention:
   flip the current SearchRegular horizontally via CSS
   `transform: scaleX(-1)`. Right-alignment already achieved.
4. Title styling matches OOB section-header: 14px Segoe UI, weight 400,
   color #242424, padding 4px 0px, letter-spacing 0. text-transform
   uppercase belt-and-suspenders with #1.
5. NEW refresh icon (`ArrowClockwiseRegular`) on the toolbar, LEFT of the
   lookup icon. Click saves the form then refreshes it.
6. Remove the Row-2 record-name cell entirely (owner uses the OOB name
   field placed elsewhere on the form). Row 2 becomes single-column
   `[record-number hyperlink]` only. Also remove the em-dash placeholder
   for the record-number empty state and the empty-name placeholder.
7. Version bump 1.3.0 → 1.3.1 across all 7 anchors per SRFR-033's checklist:
   ControlManifest.Input.xml, index.ts CONTROL_VERSION, UI footer BUILD_DATE
   (2026-07-03), Solution/solution.xml, Solution Control Manifest,
   package.json, pack.ps1.

Update tests: bulk 1.3.0 → 1.3.1; add tests for uppercase title
rendering, `showVersionFooter` toggle, refresh-icon click behavior, Row-2
single-column structure (no record-name cell, no em-dash placeholder).

Step 9.5 quality gates: /code-review + /adr-check + `npm run build:prod`.
Deploy: pack solution, `pac solution import --force-overwrite`, verify via
`pac solution list`.
  ]]></prompt>

  <role>PCF developer familiar with Spaarke PCF version discipline (`src/client/pcf/CLAUDE.md`), Fluent v9 Griffel + tokens (`ADR-021`), virtual PCF platform-library pattern (`ADR-022`), shared PolymorphicPicker (`ADR-012`), and Dataverse OOB form styling conventions.</role>

  <goal><![CDATA[
RegardingResolver v1.3.1 deployed to spaarkedev1, verified via `pac solution list`.
All 7 owner-requested visual polish changes shipped:
  - Uppercased "RELATED RECORD" title matching OOB section-header type
  - `showVersionFooter` (default true) input property gates footer visibility
  - Lookup icon horizontally flipped to match OOB direction
  - Title styled Segoe UI 14px/#242424/weight 400/padding 4px 0px
  - New refresh toolbar button (save + refresh form) LEFT of lookup icon
  - Row 2 = single record-number hyperlink cell (no name, no em-dash placeholder)
  - All 7 version anchors bumped 1.3.0 → 1.3.1
Tests updated + passing. `npm run build:prod` passes. ADR-021/022/012 preserved.
Backward-compat: existing v1.3.0 form bindings continue to function; new
`showVersionFooter` prop's default preserves footer behavior.
  ]]></goal>

