  <constraints>
    <constraint source="ADR-022">Virtual PCF pattern preserved. React 16 + Fluent 9 platform-libraries. No bundling regression.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-021">Fluent v9 semantic tokens for tokens where OOB parity isn't required. The title styling deliberately uses hardcoded #242424 + Segoe UI to match OOB section-header — this is a documented exception (matches Dataverse OOB convention exactly, not a Fluent v9 theme target).</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-012">Shared PolymorphicPicker consumption preserved. Do NOT modify the shared component; the icon-flip is a consumer-side CSS transform on the picker's rendered root.</constraint>
    <constraint source="spec NFR-04">Backward compat: existing form bindings continue to function. New `showVersionFooter` prop defaults to `true` preserving v1.3.0 footer behavior. Removals (record-name cell, em-dash placeholders) are the intentional visual changes.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">No new npm dependencies. `@fluentui/react-icons` already provides `ArrowClockwiseRegular` (verified in RegardingResolver/node_modules).</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Refresh handler uses existing `getXrm()` helper from RegardingResolverApp; no new Xrm bridge needed.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">TypeScript strict mode; no `any` unless behind an explicit shape cast at an Xrm seam (like existing getXrm return).</constraint>
    <constraint source="src/client/pcf/CLAUDE.md — Version Update Checklist">ALL 7 anchors bumped together per SRFR-033's expanded list (manifest, index.ts, footer, solution.xml, Solution ControlManifest, package.json, pack.ps1).</constraint>
  </constraints>

  <knowledge>
    <topic>pcf/version-discipline + Fluent v9 icon usage + OOB form styling parity</topic>
    <files>
      <file>src/client/pcf/CLAUDE.md</file>
      <file>src/client/shared/Spaarke.UI.Components/src/components/PolymorphicPicker/PolymorphicPicker.tsx</file>
      <file>.claude/patterns/pcf/fluent-v9-modern-theming.md</file>
    </files>
    <patterns>
      <pattern name="Fluent v9 icon rotation via CSS transform" location=".claude/patterns/pcf/fluent-v9-modern-theming.md">
        Icon direction changes for OOB parity are applied at the consumer via
        Griffel `makeStyles` on a wrapper span; do NOT swap the icon component
        itself (breaks tests + accessibility) and do NOT patch the shared lib.
      </pattern>
      <pattern name="Version-anchor 7-location bump" location="projects/set-regarding-and-field-mapping-resolver-r1/tasks/033-regarding-resolver-preserve-and-version.poml">
        SRFR-033 established the 7-anchor discipline. Grep for old version
        string across the RegardingResolver folder before finalizing to
        confirm no straggling references.
      </pattern>
    </patterns>
  </knowledge>

  <context>
    <background>
      Owner reviewed deployed RegardingResolver v1.3.0 on the sprk_todo form.
      Screenshot showed Row 1 "Related Record" + search icon; Row 2 "— PAT-212344"
      (em-dash placeholder next to record number because the record-name column
      was not populated on the test record). Owner also shared the OOB
      Dataverse "REGARDING" section header as the target visual for the title.
      This task is an out-of-plan polish pass after Wave 8 UAT; it lands as
      v1.3.1 to preserve v1.3.0 as the shipped baseline in case rollback needed.
    </background>
    <dependencies>
      <dependency task="SRFR-033" status="completed">v1.3.0 versioning + read-only preservation shipped.</dependency>
      <dependency task="SRFR-080" status="completed">v1.3.0 solution deployed to spaarkedev1 (Wave 8).</dependency>
    </dependencies>
    <related-work>
      <item>No downstream tasks blocked. SRFR-084 UAT continues once v1.3.1 lands.</item>
    </related-work>
  </context>

  <steps>
    <step order="0" name="Context Check">Verify context &lt; 60%. Read `src/client/pcf/CLAUDE.md` Version Update Checklist. Grep for existing `1.3.0` occurrences under `src/client/pcf/RegardingResolver/` to enumerate every anchor. Confirm `ArrowClockwiseRegular` exported from `@fluentui/react-icons`.</step>
    <step order="1" name="Manifest — title default + new showVersionFooter">Edit `ControlManifest.Input.xml`: change `title` default-value from "Related Record" → "RELATED RECORD"; add new `showVersionFooter` TwoOptions input property with default true. Preserve all other attributes.</step>
    <step order="2" name="Version bump — Location 1 (ControlManifest.Input.xml)">Update `version="1.3.1"` on the control root element in `ControlManifest.Input.xml`.</step>
    <step order="3" name="Version bump — Location 2 (index.ts CONTROL_VERSION)">Update `CONTROL_VERSION = '1.3.1'` in `RegardingResolver/index.ts`.</step>
    <step order="4" name="App refactor — title, styling, refresh button, row-2 simplify, footer gate, icon flip">
      In `RegardingResolverApp.tsx`:
      (a) Update `BUILD_DATE` constant to `'2026-07-03'`.
      (b) Read the new `showVersionFooter` input property (defaults true when raw is null).
      (c) Rewrite the `useStyles` `title`, `row2`, `footer` styles. Add a new
          `pickerContainer` style with `[data-testid="polymorphic-picker-trigger"] { transform: scaleX(-1); }` to flip the search icon.
      (d) Uppercase the title unconditionally in the component (belt-and-suspenders with manifest default).
      (e) Add a new `handleRefreshClick` callback: save the form via `xrm.Page.data.entity.save()` then `xrm.Page.data.refresh(true)`; fallback to `window.location.reload()` when Xrm unavailable. Catch and warn on failure.
      (f) Add a `Toolbar` in Row 1 that contains a refresh `ToolbarButton` (ArrowClockwiseRegular) LEFT of the existing PolymorphicPicker. The picker's toolbar remains unchanged; use a flex container so refresh is on the far right of the "actions" area but LEFT of the picker's own toolbar. Preserve read-only behavior: hide the refresh button when `readOnly`.
      (g) Remove Row 2 record-name Text component AND the em-dash placeholder for empty record-number. Row 2 now renders ONLY the record-number Link (or nothing if empty).
      (h) Wrap the footer render in `showVersionFooter && ( ... )`.
      (i) Update version footer string to `v{version} • Built {BUILD_DATE}` (unchanged shape — version prop from index.ts is now 1.3.1).
    </step>
    <step order="5" name="Version bump — Location 4 (Solution manifest)">Update `Solution/solution.xml` `<Version>` element to `1.3.1`.</step>
    <step order="6" name="Version bump — Location 5 (Solution Control Manifest)">Update `Solution/Controls/sprk_Spaarke.Controls.RegardingResolver/ControlManifest.xml` version attribute to `1.3.1`. Also sync the new v1.3 manifest properties (title, showVersionFooter, regardingRecordNumberField, regardingRecordNameField) if the extracted manifest lags — the earlier discovery revealed the extracted file was missing v1.3 additions. Best practice: re-sync from the source manifest but keep this scope MINIMAL (only version + new/missing properties).</step>
    <step order="7" name="Version bump — Location 6 (package.json)">Update `package.json` `"version": "1.3.1"`.</step>
    <step order="8" name="Version bump — Location 7 (pack.ps1)">Update `$version = "1.3.1"` in `Solution/pack.ps1`.</step>
    <step order="9" name="Tests — bulk version + new coverage">
      In `__tests__/RegardingResolverApp.test.tsx`:
      (a) Bulk grep/replace 1.3.0 → 1.3.1 (version prop and version regex).
      (b) Update the buildContext helper to include `showVersionFooter` in the context stub parameters.
      (c) Add test: default title renders uppercased ("RELATED RECORD") even when maker sets "related record".
      (d) Add test: `showVersionFooter: false` hides the version footer.
      (e) Add test: `showVersionFooter: true` (default) shows footer with v1.3.1.
      (f) Add test: refresh button renders; click invokes `xrm.Page.data.entity.save()` then `xrm.Page.data.refresh(true)`.
      (g) Add test: refresh button hidden under readOnly.
      (h) Add test: Row 2 does NOT contain record-name element (`queryByTestId('regarding-resolver-record-name')` is null); Row 2 does NOT contain em-dash placeholder for empty record-number (`queryByTestId('regarding-resolver-record-number-empty')` is null).
      (i) Bulk-remove any assertions on the removed elements from prior tests.
    </step>
    <step order="10" name="Grep verification">Grep for `1.3.0` under `src/client/pcf/RegardingResolver/` (exclude node_modules + out + Solution/bin). Assert zero straggling references. Confirm exactly ONE `version="1.3.1"` on `ControlManifest.Input.xml`.</step>
    <step order="11" name="Build">Run `npm run build:prod` in `src/client/pcf/RegardingResolver/`. Confirm build passes. Confirm bundle-size delta remains consistent with virtual pattern.</step>
    <step order="12" name="Test run">Run `npm test` in `src/client/pcf/RegardingResolver/`. Confirm all tests pass.</step>
    <step order="9.5" name="Quality Gate">Invoke `/code-review` and `/adr-check` on modified files: ControlManifest.Input.xml, index.ts, RegardingResolverApp.tsx, solution.xml, extracted ControlManifest.xml, package.json, pack.ps1, RegardingResolverApp.test.tsx. Address findings or escalate per CLAUDE.md §6.5.</step>
    <step order="13" name="Copy bundle + pack solution">Copy `out/controls/RegardingResolver/bundle.js` to `Solution/Controls/sprk_Spaarke.Controls.RegardingResolver/bundle.js`. Run `Solution/pack.ps1` to produce `Solution/bin/RegardingResolverSolution_v1.3.1.zip`.</step>
    <step order="14" name="Deploy">Run `pac solution import --path Solution/bin/RegardingResolverSolution_v1.3.1.zip --force-overwrite --publish-changes` against spaarkedev1. Verify via `pac solution list | Select-String RegardingResolver` shows Version 1.3.1.</step>
    <step order="15" name="Update Task Status">Update SRFR-034 status → completed, notes summary. Update TASK-INDEX.md — add row for SRFR-034 under Wave 3 as a post-Wave 3 follow-on. Reset current-task.md.</step>
  </steps>

  <tools>
    <tool name="Read">Load spec, CLAUDE.md checklist, ADRs, current source</tool>
    <tool name="Edit">Manifest + code + tests + solution manifests</tool>
    <tool name="Grep">Verify no straggling `1.3.0` references</tool>
    <tool name="Bash">`npm run build:prod`, `npm test`, `pack.ps1`, `pac solution import`, `pac solution list`</tool>
  </tools>

  <outputs>
    <output type="code">src/client/pcf/RegardingResolver/RegardingResolver/ControlManifest.Input.xml</output>
    <output type="code">src/client/pcf/RegardingResolver/RegardingResolver/index.ts</output>
