    <criterion testable="true">`ControlManifest.Input.xml` has `<property name="showVersionFooter" ... default-value="true">`.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">`ControlManifest.Input.xml` `title` default-value is `RELATED RECORD` (uppercase).</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">`RegardingResolverApp.tsx` renders title UPPERCASED unconditionally.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">CSS transform `scaleX(-1)` applied to the picker's trigger button (grep for `scaleX(-1)` in RegardingResolverApp.tsx).</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Title style has font-size 14px, color #242424, padding 4px 0px, letter-spacing 0.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Refresh button (`ArrowClockwiseRegular`) renders LEFT of the picker; hidden under `readOnly`.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Refresh click invokes `xrm.Page.data.entity.save()` then `xrm.Page.data.refresh(true)`.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Row 2 renders only the record-number Link (no record-name Text, no em-dash placeholder).</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">`showVersionFooter=false` hides footer; default (true) shows footer with `v1.3.1 • Built 2026-07-03`.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">`npm run build:prod` succeeds with zero errors.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">`npm test` all tests pass.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Platform-library declarations for React 16 and Fluent 9 preserved in ControlManifest.Input.xml.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">`/code-review` and `/adr-check` pass at Step 9.5 (or findings addressed / escalated per CLAUDE.md §6.5).</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">`pac solution list` shows RegardingResolverSolution v1.3.1 after deploy.</criterion>
  </acceptance-criteria>

  <notes><![CDATA[
Completed 2026-07-03. All 7 owner-requested changes shipped. v1.3.1 deployed
to spaarkedev1 (verified via `pac solution list`). All 51 unit tests pass
including 9 new SRFR-034 tests. `/code-review` + `/adr-check` clean
(ADR-021 hardcoded #242424 title is a documented Path A exception —
owner-approved for OOB parity).

Deploy discovery: Dataverse PCF XSD `noAposStringType` forbids apostrophes
in `description-key` attributes. First import attempt failed on three
apostrophes I added to the extracted Solution ControlManifest.xml while
sync'ing the missing v1.3 properties. Removed apostrophes, rebuilt, repacked,
re-imported successfully. See notes/task-034-regarding-resolver-ui-polish.log
for full session log + follow-on backlog.

Files modified: 8 (see log). LOC delta +558 / -74. Build passes, bundle
1.57 MiB (parity with v1.3.0). Backward compat preserved: v1.3.0 form
bindings continue to work; new showVersionFooter defaults to true.
  ]]></notes>
</task>
